Package: tuneka
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-tk
Maintainer: Tuneka contributors <delored@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Desktop downloader for music, playlists, and videos
 Tuneka can split chaptered mixes into individually named MP3 tracks,
 download playlists, and save videos in common formats.
